// A version 1 type with a version 2 type argument, each named through a later package ID.
// Later transactions name the coin type as V2::m::One<V3::m::New>.
// Named by its defining IDs it is V1::m::One<V2::m::New>.
// `Old`, `One`, and `Wrapper` are defined in version 1, `New` in version 2. B is frozen, then the
// coin is paused. Every transfer that involves B, and every transfer after the pause, is denied.

